Error [E0113]: This value is `Unit`, but `old_seal` returns Bool <corelib>/Core/crypto::Core/crypto/crypto.jet::FileCryptoError!
  --> crypto_file_seal_bool.jet:4:19
    |
  4 |     return crypto.file_seal(recipients, source, destination)
    |                   ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `old_seal` declares Bool <corelib>/Core/crypto::Core/crypto/crypto.jet::FileCryptoError! as its result, so the value it hands back must be Bool <corelib>/Core/crypto::Core/crypto/crypto.jet::FileCryptoError!
 Fix: Hand back a Bool <corelib>/Core/crypto::Core/crypto/crypto.jet::FileCryptoError! value: convert this value to Bool <corelib>/Core/crypto::Core/crypto/crypto.jet::FileCryptoError!, or return the value you meant
